      "writtenOn": "2022-02-26T00:16:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds like they would behave pretty well. I vote for adding these messages without a CONFIG guard. Debugging/diagnosing only looking at EC log is pretty common. The size increase isn\u0027t big.\n\nThey can be silenced by disabling CC_CHARGER.",
      "parentUuid": "e24f8d7e_42165829",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 45,
